@startuml
title 图片PDF处理流程 (Image PDF Processing)

skinparam backgroundColor #f0f4f8
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

start

:纯图片PDF上传\n(扫描文档/无文本层);

:Step1: PDF -> 图片渲染\n(PdfToImageConverter)\npdfjs-dist Canvas\nscale=2 (144dpi);
note right: 输出 PageImage[]

:Step2: OCR版面分析\n(LayoutOcrService)\nPaddleOCR PP-Structure\n配置: table=False;
note right: 输出 OcrPageResult[]\nblocks: type/bbox/text/confidence

if (blockType?) then (text/title)
  :直接保留OCR文本;
elseif (table)
  :按bbox裁剪图片;
  :Base64编码;
  :Step3: VLM增强\n(VlmEnhancementService)\nDashScope qwen3-vl-flash;
  note right: table -> Markdown表格
elseif (figure)
  :按bbox裁剪图片;
  :Base64编码;
  :Step3: VLM增强\n(VlmEnhancementService)\nDashScope qwen3-vl-flash;
  note right: figure -> 类型+趋势描述
elseif (formula)
  :按bbox裁剪图片;
  :Base64编码;
  :Step3: VLM增强\n(VlmEnhancementService)\nDashScope qwen3-vl-flash;
  note right: formula -> LaTeX+符号解释
else (header)
  :直接保留OCR文本;
endif

:Step4: 转换为ParsedContent\npages: [textBlocks, tables,\nimages, formulas];

:VLM理解结果存入content\n-> 可被关键词检索;

stop

@enduml
